' alt + d
' use case code for a workout storage system in a mobile app

@startuml
left to right direction

actor "App" as App
actor "Firebase Database" as DB

rectangle "Workout Storage System" {
    usecase "Input Workout Data" as UC_Input
    usecase "Store Workout Data in Firebase" as UC_Store
    usecase "Retrieve Workout Data" as UC_Retrieve
}

App --> UC_Input
App --> UC_Retrieve

UC_Input --> UC_Store : Send exercise, sets, reps, duration
UC_Store --> DB : Save workout document
UC_Retrieve --> DB : Fetch workout records

@enduml
